"a question waiting" = "有待回覆的問題";
"A resting tab lets its page go and comes back where you left it" = "休息中的分頁會釋放網頁，回來時會停在你離開的位置";
"A resting tab's title and icon fade until you go to it" = "休息中分頁的標題和圖示會變淡，直到你切換到它";
"A right-click anywhere in the tab column has a menu." = "在分頁側欄任何位置按右鍵都有選單。";
"A save sheet for every download" = "每次下載都會顯示儲存面板";
"A second engine one key away: Return asks your default, Shift-Return asks this one, with exactly what you typed." = "第二個搜尋引擎一鍵即達：按 Return 使用預設引擎，按 Shift-Return 使用這個引擎，搜尋內容與你輸入的完全相同。";
"A separate set of spaces with its own sign-ins, history and bookmarks, in a window of its own." = "一組獨立的空間，擁有自己的登入狀態、瀏覽記錄和書籤，並在專屬的視窗中顯示。";
