"A small switch in its corner makes an article light, dark or as the window is, kept for the next one." = "角落的小開關可讓文章顯示為淺色、深色或跟隨視窗，並套用到下一篇文章。";
"A space of another profile opens in the same window, with that profile's sign-ins, as in Arc." = "其他設定檔的空間會在同一個視窗中打開，並使用該設定檔的登入狀態，就像 Arc。";
"A space with a colour gives the window a faint wash of it." = "有顏色的空間會讓視窗帶有淡淡的該色調。";
"A space's colour or gradient" = "空間的顏色或漸層";
