"Each time one connects, the window asks you first, unless you ticked “Always allow” for it — offered only for Claude Code's own `claude`, signed by Anthropic; kept 30 days at most and 7 after its last use, never with your tabs, and asked again after you press Stop; forget it here. Nothing is drawn over the page: the tab it works in wears a small dot, and Stop is on the column's foot (or the tab strip) and in File › Stop Agent (⌃⌥⌘.) until it goes. It works in tabs of its own; your tabs it can read only if you tick “Let it see my open tabs”, and never uses. It never sees passwords, card numbers, one-time codes, private tabs, cookies or Settings, and can't download or choose files. It connects through a file on this Mac only, never the network: claude mcp add search -- /path/to/Search/search-mcp." = "每次有程式連線時，視窗都會先詢問你，除非你已為它勾選「一律允許」（只提供給由 Anthropic 簽署的 Claude Code 本身的 `claude`）。最多保留 30 天，上次使用後 7 天即失效，絕不會連同你的分頁一起保留，而且你按下「停止」後會再次詢問。可在這裡取消記住。網頁上不會繪製任何東西：它操作的分頁會帶有一個小圓點，「停止」按鈕位於側欄底部（或分頁列），也可使用「檔案 › 停止代理程式」（⌃⌥⌘.），直到它結束為止。它只在自己的分頁中作業；只有你勾選「讓它看到我已打開的分頁」時才能讀取你的分頁，而且絕不會使用。它看不到密碼、信用卡號、一次性驗證碼、私密分頁、Cookie 或設定，也無法下載或選擇檔案。它只透過這部 Mac 上的檔案連線，絕不經過網路：claude mcp add search -- /path/to/Search/search-mcp。";
