"What Search fetches goes through it: pages, favicons, search suggestions, copied pictures, extensions and the Web Store, the AI add-on and Search's own updates. A video call is the exception: WebRTC sends its own traffic over UDP, which a proxy tunnel doesn't carry, so a call can still show a site your address. This Mac and .local names stay direct, so a local server still opens; a router or NAS reached by its address goes through the proxy. A proxy that can't be reached fails rather than going direct." = "Search 取得的內容都會經過它：網頁、網站圖示、搜尋建議、拷貝的圖片、延伸功能和 Web Store、AI 附加元件，以及 Search 本身的更新。視訊通話是例外：WebRTC 會自行透過 UDP 傳送資料，而代理伺服器通道無法承載 UDP，所以通話時網站仍可能看到你的位址。這部 Mac 和 .local 名稱會直接連線，因此本機伺服器仍能打開。用位址連線的路由器或 NAS 則會經由代理伺服器。連不上的代理伺服器會導致連線失敗，而不會改成直接連線。";
