"“%@” wants to record your screen or a window." = "「%@」想要錄製你的螢幕或視窗。";
"“%@” wants to use Search" = "「%@」想要使用 Search";
"“Let a script drive Search” was turned on outside Settings, and stays off" = "「讓指令碼操控 Search」是在設定以外被開啟的，因此維持關閉";
"“Let coding agents use Search” was turned on outside Settings, and stays off" = "「讓程式開發代理使用 Search」是在設定以外被開啟的，因此維持關閉";
"⇧⌘R shows a page's article alone, in clean type. Most docs sites publish a Markdown copy; nothing in it can run, its text is escaped." = "按 ⇧⌘R 會以清爽的字型單獨顯示網頁的文章。大多數文件網站都有提供 Markdown 版本；其中的內容無法執行，文字都已跳脫處理。";
"⇧⌘T brings a tab back with its Back and Forward, and brings back Settings, History and the other pages of Search." = "⇧⌘T 會帶回分頁及其上一頁和下一頁，也會帶回設定、瀏覽記錄和 Search 的其他頁面。";
"⇧⌘W closes the window, the mouse's side buttons change space, and media keys reach the page." = "⇧⌘W 關閉視窗、滑鼠側邊按鈕切換空間，媒體鍵可傳到網頁。";
"⌃Tab goes to a link opened behind" = "⌃Tab 會前往在背景開啟的連結";
"⌃Tab shows your recent tabs as pictures, the last one first: a quick ⌃Tab goes back to the tab you were on." = "⌃Tab 會以圖片顯示你最近的分頁，最後一個排在最前面：快按 ⌃Tab 會回到你先前所在的分頁。";
"⌘-click on a pin opens a new tab" = "按 ⌘ 點選釘選分頁會開啟新分頁";
"⌘-click on a pin opens a new tab, as in Arc. Settings › Spaces & Pins." = "⌘-按一下釘選項目會打開新分頁，就像 Arc。在「設定 › 空間與釘選」。";
"⌘-click opening a link in the same tab on some shops." = "在某些商店網站上，⌘-按一下會在同一個分頁中打開連結。";
"⌘1–⌘9 counting a group's closed tabs." = "⌘1–⌘9 將群組中已關閉的分頁也算進去。";
"⌘1–⌘9 on every keyboard layout, Tab between a form's fields, dragging tabs, a double-click along the top to fill the screen, and the Mac's beep while typing." = "各種鍵盤配置上的 ⌘1–⌘9、表單欄位之間的 Tab、拖移分頁、在頂端按兩下填滿螢幕，以及輸入時 Mac 的嗶聲。";
"⌘1–⌘9 switch spaces" = "⌘1–⌘9 切換空間";
"⌘1–⌘9 switch spaces, as in Arc. Settings › Spaces & Pins." = "⌘1–⌘9 切換空間，就像 Arc。在「設定 › 空間與釘選」。";
"⌘K always opens the list of your tabs, whatever the page." = "無論在哪個網頁，⌘K 一律打開你的分頁列表。";
"⌘Q asks first, so a slip doesn't close every window." = "⌘Q 會先詢問，避免不小心關閉所有視窗。";
"⌘R reloads the page in a peek, and a link's menu starts with Open Link in New Tab." = "⌘R 會重新載入預覽視窗中的網頁，連結的選單以「在新分頁中打開連結」開頭。";
"⌘S folds the sidebar away, a middle-click closes a tab, a tab can be renamed, and the Web Inspector is in the View menu." = "⌘S 收起側邊欄、按滑鼠中鍵關閉分頁、可為分頁重新命名，「顯示方式」選單中有網頁檢閱器。";
"⌘S forgetting the hidden column, and spelling corrected with correction off." = "⌘S 忘記已隱藏的側欄，以及關閉校正後仍會校正拼字。";
"⌘S makes the column icons only" = "⌘S 讓側欄只顯示圖示";
"⌘S slides the column at once, and keeping a bookmark no longer stalls a window with many tabs." = "⌘S 會立即滑動側欄，儲存書籤也不再讓分頁很多的視窗卡住。";
"⌘T opening its page in a group, from an empty tab left there." = "⌘T 在群組中打開網頁，原因是群組中留有空白分頁。";
"⌘T raises the address field over the page you are on, as in Arc." = "⌘T 會在你目前的網頁上方顯示網址欄，就像 Arc。";
"⌘T raises the address field over the page, as in Arc" = "⌘T 會把網址欄叫出到網頁上方，與 Arc 相同";
"⌘W closes every tab picked in the column; a tab in a group is put away rather than closed." = "⌘W 會關閉側欄中選取的每個分頁，群組中的分頁則會收起而不是關閉。";
"⌘Z reopens a closed tab" = "⌘Z 重新打開已關閉的分頁";
"⌘← and ⌘→ go back and forward again." = "⌘← 和 ⌘→ 再次可用來返回和前進。";
"⌥-click a link opens it in Split View" = "按 ⌥ 點選連結會在分割顯示中打開";
"⌥-click a tab to put it beside the page in Split View." = "⌥-按一下分頁，即可在分割顯示中將它放在網頁旁邊。";
"⌫ leaving the page you were typing in." = "⌫ 會離開你正在輸入的網頁。";
